BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://houstonheights.org
 /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CE80E614CB2502B3AA564CB4359A4921_0.webp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://houstonheights.org/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/CE80E614CB2502B3AA564CB4359A4921_0.webp
UID:G6U9A7U8CaqNpY_I-C4w3
SUMMARY:Heights Garden Club Presents: Angel Wing Arts brings this Bee Water
	ing Station Craft to the Heights Garden Club
DTSTAMP:20260807T044504Z
DTSTART:20260826T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:AUGUST 26th at 6:30pm\, join us at the Heights Fire Station \nC
	arolyn\, of Angel Wing Arts\, (Instagram @cacoatesart or @anglewingarts) a
	nd one of our own\, will lead this workshop. Carolyn has been active in th
	e arts for over 30 years\, from faux finishes to murals to art pieces. She
	 has worked with clients and their art needs\, and her work itself is whim
	sical and fun. Please join us on August 26\, at our favorite spot to mingl
	e\, the historic Heights Fire station on 12th and Yale streets. There will
	 be a demo\, and plenty of inspiration to kick off your creativity!! \nEac
	h participant will construct two bee watering stations from clay pots and 
	saucers and then decorate them with paints and pens\, as seen in the photo
	. Let’s help our bees and butterflies in this heat by providing them a saf
	e place to get a drink that YOU are providing with your cute\, personalize
	d vessel. \nReserve your spot through Sign-Up Genius so we have an accurat
	e headcount and can make sure we have the right amount of supplies on hand
	. But hurry\, there is only room for 25 guests and the deadline to sign up
	 is August 19th. $20 cash per person\, ages 12 and up\, to be paid at the 
	door. Please\, no unaccompanied minors. Doors opens at 6:30pm\, Class is 7
	-9pm. Please arrive early so that instruction can begin on time. \nWater a
	nd some light refreshments will be provided\, but please consider bringing
	 a snack to share\, if you are so inclined. You may bring your own adult b
	everages if you wish. \n \n\nhttps://houstonheights.org/event/heights-gard
	en-club-presents/\n\nFrom Houston Heights Association
URL:https://houstonheights.org/event/heights-garden-club-presents/
LOCATION:Houston Heights City Hall & Fire Station\, 107 W. 12th Street\, Ho
	uston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-heights-association
CATEGORIES:Houston Heights Association
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
